sequenceDiagram
  actor Victim
  participant App as Flutter App
  participant API as FastAPI Backend
  participant CC as Case Crypto
  participant IPFS as IPFS (private node)
  participant DB as Postgres (metadata)
  participant L as Ledger Service
  participant ETH as EvidenceRegistry (local)

  Victim->>App: Select evidence file + consent
  App->>API: POST /evidence/upload (file, case_id)
  API->>API: sha256(original), derive copy, sha256(copy)
  API->>CC: encrypt(original, copy) with case DEK
  CC-->>API: ciphertexts (nonce + tag)
  API->>IPFS: add(ciphertext) + pin
  IPFS-->>API: cidOriginal, cidCopy
  API->>DB: insert Evidence(hashes, CIDs, wrappedKeyRef)
  API->>L: append custody events (INGEST, COPY, STORE, OCR, FORENSICS)
  L->>L: entry_n = H(entry_n-1 ‖ stage ‖ output_hash ‖ ts)
  L->>L: leaves L = H(0x00 ‖ case_salt ‖ entry), rebuild tree -> caseRoot_k
  L->>DB: insert custody events
  L->>ETH: anchor(caseCommitment, caseRoot_k)
  ETH->>ETH: require(msg.sender == registrar), append to history
  ETH-->>L: RootAnchored(caseCommitment, caseRoot_k, index k, time) + txHash
  L->>DB: insert ChainAnchor(k, caseRoot_k, txHash, block)
  API-->>App: 201 Created {evidenceId, hashes, cids, caseRoot, txHash}
  App-->>Victim: Confirmation + anchor receipt
